# Waivers for the Trivy gate in .github/workflows/docker-publish.yml.
#
# The gate fails a build on any CRITICAL or HIGH vulnerability that has a fixed
# version. List a vulnerability here only when it cannot be fixed in this image
# yet, and only for a limited time. Each waiver is one ID on its own line, with a
# comment above it giving the reason and the date it expires, for example:
#
#   # Reason: <why it cannot be fixed yet, and what we are waiting for>
#   # Expires: YYYY-MM-DD (remove the line, or renew it with a new reason)
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#
# Trivy also accepts "exp:YYYY-MM-DD" after the ID, which makes it stop
# honouring the waiver on that date:
#
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# There are no waivers at present.
